  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Nether_Structures/BH_MNS_header.webp\" alt=\"横幅\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"支持 Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=c20045&label=DISCORD&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-c20045?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-c20045?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 项目\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fnether-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"查看结构\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Nether_Structures/BH_MNS_overview.webp\" alt=\"概览\"></p>\n<p>本模组支持 Forge、Fabric、NeoForge 和 Quilt！也支持仅服务端安装。1.20.4 版本后已停止对 Forge 的支持。</p>\n<h3>关于</h3>\n<p>Moogs Nether Structures 为《我的世界》的下界维度增添了全新且令人兴奋的结构。探索过程中，你将发现战利品、强大的敌人以及有趣的挑战。本模组既可单独运行，也可与我们的主结构模组 MVS 配合使用。它能完美融入各类整合包，同时保留原版游戏的风格。跳入下界，去探索你的发现吧！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fnether-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"在 3D 中实时浏览所有结构\"></a></p>\n<p>查看我们的主结构模组 MVS，点击<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moogs-voyager-structures\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>。</p>\n<h3>配置包</h3>\n<p>模组的所有方面均可通过数据包进行自定义。带有完整说明的模板可在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mns-moogs-nether-structures-config-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>获取。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Nether_Structures/BH_MNS_features.webp\" alt=\"功能\"> <img src=\"https://imgur.com/RH0cIuq.png\" alt=\"拼贴图\"></p>\n<h3>视频</h3>\n<div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kVKuCqDgfsY?si=IN54-VglgPArp0d-?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/wlzgAujeqFY?si=3V3KSkn-BeHOrrIY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<h3>整合包</h3>\n<p>查看所有整合包，请前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252ffinder%253fincluded_mods%253d55402\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这里</a>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Nether_Structures/BH_MNS_discord.webp\" alt=\"横幅\"></p>\n<p>获得回复的最佳且最快捷的方式是加入我们的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmns\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Nether_Structures/BH_MNS_promo.webp\" alt=\"BH 赞助\"></a></p>",
